{"unit_id":"kuaiyukuaikuai__dsh-agent-sync#card-zh","repo":"kuaiyukuaikuai/dsh-agent-sync","commit":"d0dde63bdda9e50408a23b15fc79494f54b5fcb8","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-agent-sync 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的插件，用于把其他 AI agent 的 MCP 服务器和 Skills 接入 DSH。它在 DSH 注册扫描、同步和管理工具，并提供设置中的 MCP/Skills 面板。用户可扫描多种本地 agent 配置、同步 MCP 到 profile 补丁、复制或链接 Skills 到全局或工作区目录，也可添加、迁移、启停和移除项目。适合希望在 DSH 集中复用本机 agent 工具与技能的用户。需要 Node.js 22.5 及以上版本，并在同一台机器安装待扫描的 agent；不需要额外 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:1488-1532","index.mjs:1630-1678","client.js:1033-1037","package.json:31-40"]}
{"unit_id":"kuaiyukuaikuai__dsh-agent-sync#card-en","repo":"kuaiyukuaikuai/dsh-agent-sync","commit":"d0dde63bdda9e50408a23b15fc79494f54b5fcb8","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-agent-sync scans local AI agent configs and brings their MCP servers and skills into DSH. Tools sync MCP entries to profile patches and copy or link skills to global or workspace folders. A settings panel manages items. Requires Node.js 22.5+ and local agents; no API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:1488-1532","index.mjs:1630-1678","client.js:1033-1037","package.json:31-40"]}
